-.B lvconvert \-\-type cache-pool \-\-poolmetadata VG/CacheMetaLV
-.RS
-.B VG/CacheDataLV
-.RE
-
-.I Example
-.br
-# lvconvert \-\-type cache\-pool \-\-poolmetadata vg/cache0meta vg/cache0
