+.SH NAME
+lvmpolld \(em LVM poll daemon
+.SH SYNOPSIS
+.B lvmpolld
+.RB [ \-l | \-\-log
+.RI { all | wire | debug }]
+.RB [ \-p | \-\-pidfile
+.IR pidfile_path ]
