-.RS
-.IP
-\fB=~\fP matching regular expression.
-.IP
-\fB!~\fP not matching regular expression.
-.IP
-\fB= \fP equal to.
-.IP
-\fB!=\fP not equal to.
-.IP
-\fB>=\fP greater than or equal to.
-.IP
-\fB> \fP greater than
-.IP
-\fB<=\fP less than or equal to.
-.IP
-\fB< \fP less than.
-.RE
-
