+.TH LVS 8 "LVM TOOLS 2.02.169(2)-git (2016-11-30)" "Red Hat, Inc."
+.SH NAME
+.
+lvs \- Display information about logical volumes
+.P
+.
+.SH SYNOPSIS
+.br
+.P
+.
+\fBlvs\fP
+.br
+    [ \fIoption_args\fP ]
+.br
+    [ \fIposition_args\fP ]
+.br
+.P
+
+.SH DESCRIPTION
+lvs produces formatted output about LVs.
+
+.P
+.SH USAGE
+.br
+.P
+.
+\fBlvs\fP
+.br
+.RS 4
+.ad l
+[ \fB-H\fP|\fB--history\fP ]
+.ad b
