+.ad b
+
+.RE
+.br
+
+Common options for lvm:
+.
+.RS 4
+.ad l
+[ \fB-d\fP|\fB--debug\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-h\fP|\fB--help\fP ]
+.ad b
