+.TH PVDISPLAY 8 "LVM TOOLS 2.02.169(2)-git (2016-11-30)" "Red Hat, Inc."
+.SH NAME
+.
+pvdisplay \- Display various attributes of physical volume(s)
+.P
+.
+.SH SYNOPSIS
+.br
+.P
+.
+\fBpvdisplay\fP
+.br
+    [ \fIoption_args\fP ]
+.br
+    [ \fIposition_args\fP ]
+.br
+.P
+
+.SH DESCRIPTION
+pvdisplay shows the attributes of PVs, like size, physical extent size,
+space used for the VG descriptor area, etc.
+
+\fBpvs\fP(8) is a preferred alternative that shows the same information
+and more, using a more compact and configurable output format.
+
+.P
+.SH USAGE
+.br
+.P
+.
+\fBpvdisplay\fP
+.br
+.RS 4
+.ad l
+[ \fB-a\fP|\fB--all\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-c\fP|\fB--colon\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-C\fP|\fB--columns\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-m\fP|\fB--maps\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-o\fP|\fB--options\fP \fIString\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-S\fP|\fB--select\fP \fIString\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-s\fP|\fB--short\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-O\fP|\fB--sort\fP \fIString\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[    \fB--aligned\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
