+.ad b
+
+.HP
+.ad l
+\fB-n\fP|\fB--novolumegroup\fP
+.br
+Only show PVs not belonging to any VG.
+.ad b
+
+.HP
+.ad l
+\fB--profile\fP \fIString\fP
