+.TH VGIMPORT 8 "LVM TOOLS 2.02.169(2)-git (2016-11-30)" "Red Hat, Inc."
+.SH NAME
+.
+vgimport \- Register exported volume group with system
+.P
+.
+.SH SYNOPSIS
+.br
+.P
+.
+\fBvgimport\fP \fIoption_args\fP \fIposition_args\fP
+.br
+    [ \fIoption_args\fP ]
+.br
+.P
+
+.SH DESCRIPTION
+vgimport makes exported VGs known to the system again, perhaps after
+moving the PVs from a different system.
+
+vgexport clears the VG system ID, and vgimport sets the VG system ID to
+match the host running vgimport (if the host has a system ID).
+
+.P
+.SH USAGE
+.br
+.P
+.
+Import specified VGs.
+.br
+.P
+\fBvgimport\fP \fIVG\fP|\fITag\fP|\fISelect\fP ...
+.br
+.RS 4
+.ad l
+[ \fB-S\fP|\fB--select\fP \fIString\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+[ COMMON_OPTIONS ]
+.RE
+.br
+
+
+Import all VGs.
+.br
+.P
+\fBvgimport\fP \fB-a\fP|\fB--all\fP
+.br
+.RS 4
+[ COMMON_OPTIONS ]
+.RE
+.br
+
+
+Common options for command:
+.
+.RS 4
+.ad l
+[ \fB-f\fP|\fB--force\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[    \fB--reportformat\fP \fBbasic\fP|\fBjson\fP ]
+.ad b
+
+.RE
+.br
+
+Common options for lvm:
+.
+.RS 4
+.ad l
+[ \fB-d\fP|\fB--debug\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-h\fP|\fB--help\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-q\fP|\fB--quiet\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
+[ \fB-t\fP|\fB--test\fP ]
+.ad b
+.br
+.ad l
