+.br
+.P
+\fBvgrename\fP \fIVG\fP \fIVG\fP\fI_new\fP
+.br
+.RS 4
+[ COMMON_OPTIONS ]
+.RE
+.br
+
+
+Rename a VG by specifying the VG UUID.
